### Tag Differences

`hcompoundmatn.Matn` uses a **completely different tag set** from hadith/services:

| hcompoundmatn Tags | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `Root` | Document root wrapper |
| `Document`, `MutonBook` | Book-level grouping |
| `Muton` | Individual matn segment |
| `MMHit` | Variant reading highlight (has `HIDs`, `MMID`, `MMSText` attrs) |
| `MMMainHadith` | Primary hadith reference |
| `MMPortionSources`, `MMPortionsFootNote` | Source cross-references |
| `CompounMatnSame` | Identical text marker |

> [!NOTE]
> `AsanedComp` column has 0 non-empty rows — it's effectively unused.

