### 6B. Annotation-Based Renderer

#### [NEW] [annotationRenderer.ts](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/Hadith/spa/src/utils/annotationRenderer.ts)

Converts `CleanContent` + `Annotation[]` → `ASTNode[]` (same type as `hadithParser.ts`):

**Algorithm**:
1. Build parent-child tree from flat `Annotation[]` using `parentIndex`
2. Sort root annotations by `start` ascending
3. Walk the clean text, slicing character ranges into `text` nodes and wrapping annotated ranges into `element` nodes with `tag`, `attrs` (including synthesized `ربط` from `linkId`)
4. Recurse for nested children

Output is identical `ASTNode[]`, so `HadithContentRenderer`'s `renderASTNode` switch/case works unchanged.

